{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-11-29 16:30:00', 'title': "OMNICOM'S CREDERA ANNOUNCED SUPPORT FOR AWS FOR ADVERTISING & MARKETING INITIATIVE", 'text': 'DALLAS , NOV. 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CREDERA , A GLOBAL BOUTIQUE CONSULTING FIRM FOCUSED ON STRATEGY, TRANSFORMATION, DATA, AND TECHNOLOGY, TODAY ANNOUNCED SUPPORT FOR THE AWS FOR ADVERTISING AND MARKETING \xa0INITIATIVE FROM AMAZON WEB SERVICES (AWS) TO ACCELERATE ADVERTISING AND MARKETING TRANSFORMATION. "THIS NEW INITIATIVE [DELIVERS] CUTTING-EDGE SOLUTIONS FOR MARKETERS AND WORLD-CLASS EXPERIENCES FOR CUSTOMERS.'}